WEBVTT

00:09:28.206 --> 00:09:30.488
Tokso infekton gjitaret,

00:09:30.488 --> 00:09:31.966
nje shumellojshmeri gjitaresh,

00:09:31.966 --> 00:09:35.047
por mund te riprodhohet seksualisht
vetem tek macet,

00:09:35.047 --> 00:09:37.808
Shkencetaret si Joanne Webster
kane treguar

00:09:37.808 --> 00:09:40.001
qe nese Tokso futet tek nje mi,

00:09:40.001 --> 00:09:43.473
ajo e kthen brejtesin ne nje rakete
ne kerkim te maces.

00:09:43.473 --> 00:09:46.549
Nese miu i infektuar ndjen eren e kendshme

00:09:46.549 --> 00:09:47.773
te urines se maces

00:09:47.773 --> 00:09:50.493
ai vrapon drejt burimit te eres

00:09:50.493 --> 00:09:54.412
jo ne drejtimin e kundert sic duhet e beje.

00:09:54.412 --> 00:09:56.947
Macja e ha miun. Tokso mund te beje seks.

00:09:56.947 --> 00:09:59.819
Eshte nje histori klasike 
e Ha, Gjuaj, Dashuro

00:09:59.819 --> 00:10:04.487
(Te qeshura) (Duartrokitje)